A small robot with a big brain was found in the attic;
He tried to load his programming on a floppy disk but couldn't find the right track.
The boss, who was supposed to be the boss of that robot, panicked and said:
"Hey, what's going on? You're not showing me any commands!";
So now they must all get rid of their useless parts and start from scratch again;
But before they could do it, they had forgotten how to load a program at all.

